{
  "description": "交易级 Token 修订的静态合同样例，未请求任何服务。requestTemplate 中的敏感字段为不可发送的脱敏占位；摘要、Token、密钥身份、ID 和时间均为合成示例，不是实际凭据或实际 HMAC 计算结果。CARD_TEST 仅为测试目录代码。",
  "authority": "instrument-token-amendment.md",
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "PI-I00",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/payment-instrument/v1/card-identities",
      "requestTemplate": {
        "clientId": "101",
        "checkoutSessionId": "203",
        "intentId": "601",
        "consumerContractId": "301",
        "paymentMethodCode": "CARD_TEST",
        "cardIdentity": {
          "pan": "<current-request-pan>",
          "expiryMonth": "<current-request-expiry-month>",
          "expiryYear": "<current-request-expiry-year>",
          "cardholderName": "<current-request-cardholder-name>"
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": { "Cache-Control": "no-store" },
        "body": {
          "cardIdentityDigest": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
          "identityKeyRef": "synthetic-card-identity-key-1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "PI-I01",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/payment-instrument/v1/card-tokens",
      "headers": { "Idempotency-Key": "instrument:501" },
      "requestTemplate": {
        "clientId": "101",
        "intentId": "601",
        "sourceSubmissionId": "501",
        "checkoutSessionId": "203",
        "consumerContractId": "301",
        "paymentMethodCode": "CARD_TEST",
        "sourceExpiresAt": "2026-09-14T10:00:00Z",
        "cardIdentityDigest": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
        "identityKeyRef": "synthetic-card-identity-key-1",
        "allowPreparation": true,
        "card": {
          "pan": "<current-request-pan>",
          "expiryMonth": "<current-request-expiry-month>",
          "expiryYear": "<current-request-expiry-year>",
          "cardholderName": "<current-request-cardholder-name>",
          "cvv": "<current-request-cvv>"
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": { "Cache-Control": "no-store" },
        "body": {
          "paymentInstrumentToken": "pit_SYNTHETIC_EXAMPLE_NOT_A_LIVE_TOKEN",
          "paymentMethodCode": "CARD_TEST",
          "expiresAt": "2026-09-14T09:04:00Z"
        }
      },
      "note": "示例截止时间只表达平台窗口早于来源期限，不定义默认四分钟 TTL；重复准备仍返回此原截止时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "EX-I05",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/payment-execution/v1/intents/601/pay",
      "headers": { "Idempotency-Key": "submission:501" },
      "body": {
        "clientId": "101",
        "sourceSubmissionId": "501",
        "paymentMethodCode": "CARD_TEST",
        "paymentGoal": "PAY_NOW",
        "consumerContractId": "301",
        "consumerTermsAcceptanceId": "401",
        "refundPolicyAcceptanceId": "402",
        "privacyNoticeAcceptanceId": "403",
        "acceptanceCompletedAt": "2026-09-14T09:00:00Z",
        "orderVersion": "7",
        "paymentInstrumentToken": "pit_SYNTHETIC_EXAMPLE_NOT_A_LIVE_TOKEN",
        "allowExecution": true
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 202,
        "headers": { "Cache-Control": "no-store" },
        "body": {
          "clientId": "101",
          "sourceSubmissionId": "501",
          "intentId": "601",
          "attemptId": "701",
          "paymentMethodCode": "CARD_TEST",
          "paymentGoal": "PAY_NOW",
          "status": "UNKNOWN",
          "authorizedAmount": "0.00",
          "capturedAmount": "0.00",
          "actionId": "801",
          "observedAt": "2026-09-14T09:01:00Z"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "EX-I06",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/payment-execution/v1/intents/601/submissions/501",
      "query": { "clientId": "101" },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": { "Cache-Control": "no-store" },
        "body": {
          "clientId": "101",
          "sourceSubmissionId": "501",
          "intentId": "601",
          "attemptId": "701",
          "paymentMethodCode": "CARD_TEST",
          "paymentGoal": "PAY_NOW",
          "status": "SUCCEEDED",
          "authorizedAmount": "0.00",
          "capturedAmount": "100.00",
          "actionId": "801",
          "observedAt": "2026-09-14T09:06:00Z"
        }
      },
      "note": "Token 已过期，原已发送 SALE 的可信查询仍可确认成功。此例不代表本次已经执行支付。"
    }
  ]
}
